<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是不是变量</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>改不动的地方，就是你的天花板</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>五问一起看</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>改得动几项？改不动的那些，就是你真实的上限。</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 12}}>留 10 秒安静，自己算。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>执行后端能不能换？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 12}}>门禁能不能自己定？</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 12}}>事实能不能重建？</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>29 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
